+whole-day period. When `kind` is supplied, only equipment of that kind (`'board'` or `'sail'`) is
+considered; otherwise, equipment of every kind is considered. The period uses the same UTC midnight
+timestamps and exclusive `end` as quotes and bookings, and invalid periods are rejected.
